+/*
+ * R27, R32 (ICM-PROTOCOL.md 13.4): after the ORICO left the controller
+ * was powered off 10.4-11.4 s later, not 35 s as after the dock.
+ * power-off-delay-usb4-ms applies when a USB4 device left last.
